  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecuador ACA - NICFI 2021-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Ecuador, the local partner EcoCiencia will pilot the real-time monitoring of forest degradation using high-resolution satellite imagery to develop a greater understanding of the causes of degradation. EcoCiencia will analyse government capacity, identify key gaps and follow up with authorities to improve the use of information. They will also work with the Waorani to strengthen their monitoring capacities to receive data alerts, access satellite imagery and draft technical reports.</narrative>
  </description>
